data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":76,"item_id":"rs_084cbc36ba849e45016acb0cee49248193886d56aab668a28d","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Exploring project UI requirements**\n\nI'm working on the UI helper project to extend optional destinations and manage movements. It's important to ensure there's no conflicting POST handling happening. I need to keep that in mind throughout the development process to avoid any issues down the line. It's exciting to think about how these features will improve user interactions and experiences. I'll continue refining my approach to make sure everything integrates smoothly."}

